---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "vditor/dist/index.css";
---

<Layout title="内容管理" eyebrow="Admin">
  <section class="content admin-content">
    <div class="panel" id="login-panel">
      <div class="panel-header">
        <h2>后台登录</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="panel-body">
        <form class="admin-form" id="login-form">
          <label class="admin-field">
            <span>账号</span>
            <input id="admin-username" type="text" autocomplete="username" />
          </label>
          <label class="admin-field">
            <span>密码</span>
            <input id="admin-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" />
          </label>
          <div class="filter-row">
            <button class="button" type="submit">登录</button>
            <span class="muted" id="login-status"></span>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="admin-app" hidden>
      <div class="card" id="must-change-banner" hidden>
        <strong>首次登录请修改密码</strong>
        <p class="muted">当前使用初始密码，请在下方「修改我的密码」中设置新密码后继续。</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="admin-nav" id="admin-nav" aria-label="管理导航"></aside>
      <p id="moderation-drafts-notice" class="field-hint" role="status" hidden></p>

      <div id="resource-admin-panel">
        <div class="panel admin-toolbar">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>课程资源管理</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button" id="publish" type="button">保存并发布</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="sync-r2" type="button">从 R2 同步当前课程</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="manifest-verify" type="button">按 R2 校对清单</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="sync-r2-all" type="button">从 R2 重建课程树</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="download-json" type="button">下载 JSON</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="download-backup" type="button">备份</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="logout" type="button">退出</button>
              <span class="muted" id="publish-status"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="admin-form admin-toolbar-settings" id="manifest-settings" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>

            <details class="card admin-collapsible-card" id="batch-tags-card" style="margin-top: 14px;">
              <summary>批量标签管理（多选课程）</summary>
              <div class="panel-body" style="margin-top: 14px;">
                <div class="admin-form">
                  <div class="filter-row">
                    <label class="admin-field" style="flex:1;">
                      <span>筛选课程（按名称/学期/分类）</span>
                      <input id="batch-tags-filter" type="search" placeholder="输入关键词筛选，留空显示全部" autocomplete="off" />
                    </label>
                    <button class="button secondary" id="batch-tags-select-all" type="button">全选</button>
                    <button class="button secondary" id="batch-tags-deselect-all" type="button">取消全选</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="filter-row" style="margin-top: 8px;">
                    <label class="admin-field" style="flex:1;">
                      <span>要操作的标签（逗号分隔，如：推荐, 给分好）</span>
                      <input id="batch-tags-input" type="text" placeholder="标签1, 标签2, …" autocomplete="off" />
                    </label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="filter-row" style="margin-top: 8px;">
                    <label class="admin-field" style="flex:1;">
                      <span>重命名：把左侧「原标签」换成上方填写的标签（仅勾选课程）</span>
                      <input id="batch-tags-rename-from" type="text" placeholder="原标签，如：给分 一般" autocomplete="off" />
                    </label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="filter-row" style="margin-top: 8px;">
                    <button class="button" id="batch-tags-add" type="button">添加标签到选中课程</button>
                    <button class="button secondary" id="batch-tags-remove" type="button">从选中课程移除标签</button>
                    <button class="button secondary" id="batch-tags-rename" type="button">把原标签改成新标签</button>
                    <span class="muted" id="batch-tags-status"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div id="batch-tags-list" style="margin-top: 10px; max-height: 300px; overflow-y: auto;"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="admin-workbench">
          <aside class="panel admin-tree-panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <h2>课程树</h2>
              <button class="admin-icon-button" id="collapse-tree" type="button" title="收拢左侧">‹</button>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-body">
              <input class="searchbar" id="admin-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索课程" autocomplete="off" />
              <div class="admin-tree" id="admin-course-tree"></div>
            </div>
          </aside>

          <button class="admin-resizer" id="admin-resizer" type="button" title="拖动调整宽度"></button>

          <section class="panel admin-editor-panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <h2 id="editor-title">选择课程</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-body" id="editor">
              <p class="empty">正在加载内容。</p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="review-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>评价审核管理</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button" id="save-reviews" type="button">保存评价设置</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="cancel-review-settings" type="button">取消设置草稿</button>
              <button class="button secondary clean-images" type="button" data-owner="reviews">清理未引用图片</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="reload-reviews" type="button">重新加载（保留草稿）</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="logout-reviews" type="button">退出</button>
              <span class="muted" id="review-admin-status"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="review-settings-conflict" class="moderation-conflict" hidden></div>
              <div class="review-admin-layout">
                <details class="card admin-collapsible-card" open>
                  <summary>审核规则框架</summary>
              <div class="admin-form" id="review-rules-editor" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
              <p class="moderation-provenance muted" id="review-settings-provenance"></p>
                </details>
                <div class="card">
                  <h3>评论内容</h3>
                  <div class="admin-moderation-grid" style="margin-top: 14px;">
                    <aside class="admin-moderation-sidebar">
                      <input class="searchbar" id="review-admin-sidebar-search" type="search" aria-label="筛选评价课程" placeholder="筛选课程" autocomplete="off" />
                      <div class="admin-tree" id="review-admin-sidebar" style="margin-top: 10px;"></div>
                    </aside>
                    <div class="admin-moderation-main">
                      <div class="filter-row">
                        <input class="searchbar" id="review-admin-search" type="search" aria-label="搜索评价内容" placeholder="搜索评价内容" autocomplete="off" />
                        <select class="searchbar" id="review-status-filter" aria-label="筛选已保存的评价公开状态">
                          <option value="all">全部状态</option>
                          <option value="pending">待审</option>
                          <option value="approved">已通过</option>
                          <option value="hidden">已隐藏</option>
                          <option value="rejected">公开已拒绝</option>
                          <option value="visible">公众可见</option>
                        </select>
                      </div>
                      <p class="field-hint">每条评价独立保存或取消。原文、课程、老师、评分和提交账号只读；批量处置与归并暂不提供。</p>
                      <details class="card admin-collapsible-card" style="margin-top: 14px;">
                        <summary>往目录池加课程（评价可选课程补充）</summary>
                        <div class="admin-form" style="margin-top: 14px;">
                          <div class="filter-row">
                            <label class="admin-field" style="flex:2;">
                              <span>课程名称（必填）</span>
                              <input id="catalog-add-name" type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="如：量子计算导论" autocomplete="off" />
                            </label>
                            <label class="admin-field" style="flex:1;">
                              <span>开课学院（选填）</span>
                              <input id="catalog-add-category" type="text" maxlength="80" placeholder="如：计算机学院" autocomplete="off" />
                            </label>
                            <label class="admin-field" style="flex:1;">
                              <span>学期（选填）</span>
                              <input id="catalog-add-term" type="text" maxlength="40" placeholder="如：2026-2027-1" autocomplete="off" />
                            </label>
                          </div>
                          <label class="admin-field">
                            <span>任课教师（必填，多位用顿号或逗号分隔）</span>
                            <input id="catalog-add-teachers" type="text" placeholder="如：李四、王五" autocomplete="off" />
                          </label>
                          <div class="filter-row">
                            <button class="button" type="button" id="catalog-add-submit">加入目录池</button>
                            <span class="muted" id="catalog-add-status">加入后立即生效：网页与小程序评价均可搜索并提交该课程。</span>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </details>
                      <div class="review-admin-list" id="review-admin-list" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="participate-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>参与页面管理</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button" id="save-participate" type="button">保存并发布参与页</button>
              <button class="button secondary clean-images" type="button" data-owner="participate">清理未引用图片</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="reload-participate" type="button">重新加载</button>
              <span class="muted" id="participate-admin-status"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="admin-form" id="participate-admin-editor"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="feedback-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>反馈管理</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button" id="save-feedback" type="button">保存反馈设置</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="cancel-feedback-settings" type="button">取消设置草稿</button>
              <button class="button secondary clean-images" type="button" data-owner="feedback">清理未引用图片</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="reload-feedback" type="button">重新加载（保留草稿）</button>
              <span class="muted" id="feedback-admin-status"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="feedback-settings-conflict" class="moderation-conflict" hidden></div>
            <details class="card admin-collapsible-card" open>
              <summary>反馈规则框架</summary>
              <div class="admin-form" id="feedback-settings-editor" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
              <div class="admin-form" id="feedback-rules-editor" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
              <p class="moderation-provenance muted" id="feedback-settings-provenance"></p>
            </details>
            <div class="card" style="margin-top: 18px;">
              <h3>反馈内容</h3>
              <input class="searchbar" id="feedback-admin-search" type="search" aria-label="搜索反馈标题、内容或联系方式" placeholder="搜索标题、内容或联系方式" autocomplete="off" />
              <select class="searchbar" id="feedback-status-filter" aria-label="筛选已保存的反馈状态">
                <option value="all">全部状态</option>
                <option value="open">待处理</option>
                <option value="processing">处理中</option>
                <option value="public-approved">公开已批准</option>
                <option value="public-pending">公开待审</option>
                <option value="public-rejected">公开已拒绝</option>
                <option value="completed">已完成</option>
                <option value="rejected">驳回/不予完成</option>
                <option value="parked">搁置</option>
                <option value="hidden">已隐藏</option>
              </select>
              <p class="field-hint">每条反馈独立保存或取消。处理完成、添加回复均不会批准公开；批量处置暂不提供。</p>
              <div class="review-admin-list" id="feedback-admin-list" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="links-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>友链页面管理</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button" id="save-links" type="button">保存并发布友链页</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="reload-links" type="button">重新加载</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="add-link-item" type="button">新增链接</button>
              <span class="muted" id="links-admin-status"></span>
            </div>
            <details class="card admin-collapsible-card" open>
              <summary>页面与本站信息</summary>
              <div class="admin-form" id="links-settings-editor" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
            </details>
            <div class="card" style="margin-top: 18px;">
              <h3>链接内容</h3>
              <div class="review-admin-list" id="links-admin-list" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="stats-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>访问统计</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button secondary" id="reload-stats" type="button">重新加载</button>
              <span class="muted" id="stats-admin-status"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="backup-grid" id="stats-admin-summary" style="margin-top: 18px;"></div>
            <details class="card admin-collapsible-card" style="margin-top: 18px;" open>
              <summary>访问趋势</summary>
              <div class="filter-row" style="margin-top: 12px;">
                <button class="button secondary stats-range" data-range="7" type="button">近 7 天</button>
                <button class="button secondary stats-range" data-range="30" type="button">近 30 天</button>
                <button class="button secondary stats-range" data-range="90" type="button">近 90 天</button>
              </div>
              <div class="admin-stats-chart" id="stats-admin-chart" style="margin-top: 10px;"></div>
            </details>
            <details class="card admin-collapsible-card" style="margin-top: 18px;" open>
              <summary>按类别统计</summary>
              <div id="stats-admin-categories" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
            </details>
            <details class="card admin-collapsible-card" style="margin-top: 18px;">
              <summary>页面访问明细</summary>
              <div class="review-admin-list" id="stats-admin-pages" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
            </details>
            <details class="card admin-collapsible-card" style="margin-top: 18px;">
              <summary>最近访客（IP · 30 分钟去重）</summary>
              <div class="review-admin-list" id="stats-admin-visitors" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="about-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>关于页面管理</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button" id="save-about" type="button">保存并发布关于页</button>
              <button class="button secondary clean-images" type="button" data-owner="about">清理未引用图片</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="reload-about" type="button">重新加载</button>
              <span class="muted" id="about-admin-status"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="admin-form" id="about-admin-editor"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="donate-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>捐助页面管理</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button" id="save-donate" type="button">保存并发布捐助页</button>
              <button class="button secondary clean-images" type="button" data-owner="donate">清理未引用图片</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="reload-donate" type="button">重新加载</button>
              <span class="muted" id="donate-admin-status"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="admin-form" id="donate-admin-editor"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel" style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>捐赠记录（公开表：时间 / 昵称 / 去向）</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p class="field-hint" style="margin: 0 0 12px;">支付成功后自动追加一行（无昵称显示"好心人"，去向初始"待定"）；此处可修改去向或补充历史记录，随"保存并发布捐助页"一起生效。</p>

      <div id="donate-records-editor"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel" style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>捐赠统计</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button secondary" id="reload-donate-stats" type="button">刷新统计</button>
              <input class="searchbar" id="donate-stats-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索单号 / 昵称 / 备注 / 交易号 / 金额" style="max-width: 280px;" />
              <select class="searchbar" id="donate-stats-status" style="max-width: 130px;">
                <option value="all">全部状态</option>
                <option value="paid">已支付</option>
                <option value="pending">待支付</option>
              </select>
              <select class="searchbar" id="donate-stats-source" style="max-width: 140px;">
                <option value="all">全部来源</option>
                <option value="jsapi">小程序</option>
                <option value="native">网页扫码</option>
              </select>
              <span class="muted" id="donate-stats-message"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="donate-stats-body" style="margin-top: 14px;"></div>
            <div class="filter-row" id="donate-stats-pager" style="margin-top: 10px;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel" style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>微信支付设置</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button" id="save-donate-pay" type="button">保存支付配置</button>
              <span class="muted" id="donate-pay-status"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="admin-form" id="donate-pay-editor"></div>
            <p class="field-hint">填入微信支付商户号（APIv3）并勾选启用后，小程序捐助的支付功能才会真正下单。商户私钥仅服务器保存（0600），不回显。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

            <div id="privacy-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>隐私与协议</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="filter-row">
              <button class="button" id="save-privacy" type="button">保存并发布</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="reload-privacy" type="button">重新加载</button>
              <span class="muted" id="privacy-admin-status"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="admin-form" id="privacy-admin-editor"></div>
            <p class="field-hint">公开地址 <a href="/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">/privacy/</a>；内容需与实际收集一致（手机号、IP 与日志、账号资料、保存规则、注销、举报、联系方式）。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="reports-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header split-header">
            <h2>举报处置</h2>
            <span class="muted" id="reports-admin-status"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p class="field-hint" style="margin: 0 0 12px;">违法有害信息举报与内容投诉始终私密。每条独立保存处置和回复，服务器记录处理人与时间；封禁提交账号在「小程序用户」执行。</p>
            <div class="filter-row" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
              <input class="searchbar" id="reports-search" type="search" aria-label="搜索举报" placeholder="搜索举报标题/内容/对象" />
              <select class="searchbar" id="reports-status-filter" aria-label="筛选已保存的举报处理进度" style="max-width: 140px;">
                <option value="all">全部状态</option>
                <option value="open">待处理</option>
                <option value="processing">处理中</option>
                <option value="completed">已处理</option>
                <option value="rejected">不成立</option>
                <option value="parked">搁置</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div id="reports-list"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="law-admin-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2>依法调取（内部）</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-body">
            <p class="field-hint">所有有效管理员均可查询与导出，每次请求都会留痕。对外交付资料需核验要求并记录交付对象、范围和接收确认；本机下载不代表已交付。</p>
            <p class="field-hint">时间范围（北京时间，包含起止时刻）仅筛选安全日志与管理员审计；账号与关联评价、反馈/举报作为上下文保留。操作名称分别精确匹配两类日志，留空表示全部。</p>
            <form id="law-query-form">
              <div class="law-filter-grid">
